{%- comment -%}
Product FAQ — common buyer questions on all product pages.
Outputs FAQPage JSON-LD for Google rich snippets. Content applies sitewide.
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    background: #f7f6f4;
    padding: 64px 0 72px;
    color: #2a2a2a;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-heading {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.45;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: #1c1c1c;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-item {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.11);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-item:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.11);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-item summary {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 17px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #1c1c1c;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-icon {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.22s ease;
    opacity: 0.35;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-item[open] .lgx-pfaq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-body {
    padding: 2px 0 20px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.78;
    color: #555;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-body p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .lgx-pfaq-body a {
    color: #1e616c;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
</style>

<div>
  <div class="lgx-pfaq-inner">
    <p class="lgx-pfaq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</p>

    <div class="lgx-pfaq-list">

      <details class="lgx-pfaq-item">
        <summary>
          <span>Is this item officially authenticated by LEGXI?</span>
          <span class="lgx-pfaq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="lgx-pfaq-body">
          <p>Yes. Every LEGXI collectible is obtained through a managed, witnessed signing session — no third-party intermediaries. Each item is issued a tamper-proof Certificate of Authenticity (COA) documenting the athlete, event, signing date, and unique edition number. This is not a reproduction or auto-signed item; it is an original hand-signed collectible.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="lgx-pfaq-item">
        <summary>
          <span>What is included with my purchase?</span>
          <span class="lgx-pfaq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="lgx-pfaq-body">
          <p>Your purchase includes the collectible item itself, a tamper-proof Certificate of Authenticity card with a unique verification code, and secure collector-grade packaging designed to protect the item during shipping. Some editions also include additional provenance documentation specific to the signing session.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="lgx-pfaq-item">
        <summary>
          <span>How do I verify the authenticity of my LEGXI collectible?</span>
          <span class="lgx-pfaq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="lgx-pfaq-body">
          <p>Visit the <a href="/pages/authentication">LEGXI Authentication Portal</a> and enter the unique code printed on your Certificate of Authenticity. The portal confirms the athlete, signing event, date, and the number of items authenticated in that session — giving you complete, verifiable provenance at any time.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="lgx-pfaq-item">
        <summary>
          <span>Does LEGXI ship across India?</span>
          <span class="lgx-pfaq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="lgx-pfaq-body">
          <p>Yes. LEGXI ships to all major cities and states across India. Every order is fully insured and packaged in collector-grade materials to preserve the condition and value of the item during transit. Tracking details are provided once your order is dispatched.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="lgx-pfaq-item">
        <summary>
          <span>Can I return or exchange a signed collectible?</span>
          <span class="lgx-pfaq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="lgx-pfaq-body">
          <p>Due to the one-of-a-kind nature of hand-signed collectibles, all sales are final. If your item arrives damaged or in a condition inconsistent with the listing, please contact LEGXI within 48 hours of delivery with photographs and we will resolve the issue promptly.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="lgx-pfaq-item">
        <summary>
          <span>Can I transfer ownership of my LEGXI collectible?</span>
          <span class="lgx-pfaq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="lgx-pfaq-body">
          <p>Yes. LEGXI's Ownership Transfer System allows you to register a verified transfer of ownership for any collectible. This maintains an unbroken, auditable chain of custody and preserves the full provenance record — protecting the long-term value of the item for you and any future owner.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

